<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Probanka tumbles over 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Probanka tumbles over 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian bank Probanka dropped 7.76 percent in Thursday morning trade on what traders attributed to poor liquidity in the share.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is fairly illiquid therefore even a small sell-off can cause the price to drop,&quot; said Nena Jarc, a trader at Nova Ljubljanska Banka.</p>
<p>At 1000 GMT Probanka was down 1,630 tolars to 19,370 tolars on volume of 10 shares. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
